### Complexity Bounds

| Metric | Time Complexity | Space Complexity |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Point Lookup (`search`)** | $O(\log N)$ expected, strictly wait-free | $O(1)$ dynamic overhead |
| **Mutation (`upsert`)** | $O(\log N)$ traversal + $O(1)$ CAS | $O(K + V)$ per active version |
| **Commit Phase** | $O(1)$ memory ops + $O(1)$ batched Direct I/O | $O(1)$ fixed pre-allocated buffer |
| **Garbage Reclamation** | Amortized $O(1)$ per retired node | $O(T \times \text{Threshold})$ bounded memory |
